sequenceDiagram
  participant A as ATM
  participant C as Capability API
  participant D as Device adapter
  participant L as Core ledger
  A->>C: Authorize stable operation ID
  C->>L: Commit funds hold
  A->>C: Prepare stable device command
  C->>L: Commit DISPENSE_PENDING
  A->>D: Dispense command ID
  Note over D: Commit simulated cash outcome in device DB
  D-->>A: Final dispensed amount
  A->>C: Reconcile operation ID
  C->>D: Read immutable device outcome
  C->>L: Commit actual debit, paired postings and outbox, release hold
  C-->>A: POSTED or CANCELLED
